1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,750
She switched tabs — and the exam caught it.

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:04,910
Here's what TestoZa's proctoring stops…

3
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:06,052
and what it can't.

4
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:07,970
Force full screen.

5
00:00:07,970 --> 00:00:10,130
Catch every tab or app switch —

6
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:12,130
submit at the very first one,

7
00:00:12,130 --> 00:00:14,530
or allow a few warnings, say three.

8
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:16,690
Block copy-paste, right-click,

9
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:18,976
the back button, and the exit button.

10
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:21,450
Leave full screen — warning two.

11
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:22,970
Switch again — three.

12
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:23,610
One more…

13
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:25,130
and the test is submitted.

14
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:26,108
Automatically.

15
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,940
Now the honest part.

16
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:30,340
There's no webcam watching — so it can't see

17
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:32,180
a second phone, or a friend in the room.

18
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:34,660
For big exams, add an invigilator,

19
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:35,727
or a computer lab.

20
00:00:36,263 --> 00:00:37,863
Proctoring that tells you the truth.

21
00:00:37,863 --> 00:00:39,150
testoza dot com.
